# strat-tour: the strategic screens the bot games never open. newgame-playnow (Winter 1268, Raw Sienna), then authored
# over rhbot (a Session driver; the trace is the artifact). The Town Center (click the town → 0x02): every task's labor
# panel (0x0f: grain, cattle, iron, reclamation, idle, castle, wood) and the blacksmith (each weapon picked); drag-box
# worker moves (cattle → grain → iron → castle → cattle) and a double-click. Raise an army → the armoury: bows and swords
# on the weapon-assign overlay (0x0d: up / down / all / none, the troop march on switch), Create. Fields: the Farmland
# panel (0x04) → grain / cattle / fallow icons; an industry building toggled off and on; the rations arrows (level
# 3 → 5 → 2 → 3) and the grain / meat slider (arrows, bar). File > New Game, File > Quit and Esc → the confirm dialog,
# No. Keys: F2 x3 (the debug overlays 1 → 2 → off), Alt+1 (shot1.lbm), Enter. The Court → Greatest nobles (0x20) and
# its 7 tabs. Help: Help Options (tips / tool tips toggled twice), How do I..., the four how-tos, About. The minimap's
# overlay buttons 1-3 and the magnifier: the kingdom overview (view mode 2) with edge scrolls, a county click jumps
# back, the magnifier twice. End turn x2 (Spring, Summer 1268). File > Save as "Tour1" (typed), Save again over
# lastturn; File > New Game → yes → the title → Single player → Load a game (lastturn / old turn / safeturn / tour1)
# → tour1 → Summer 1268 again.
